<sect1 id="UdpDelaySimRunner_8h_1DESCRIPTION">
<title>DESCRIPTION</title>
<para>This <ref refid="classBpReceivePacketRunner" kindref="compound">BpReceivePacketRunner</ref> class is used for launching the <ref refid="classBpReceivePacket" kindref="compound">BpReceivePacket</ref> class into its own process. The <ref refid="classBpReceivePacketRunner" kindref="compound">BpReceivePacketRunner</ref> provides a blocking Run function which creates and initializes a <ref refid="classBpReceivePacket" kindref="compound">BpReceivePacket</ref> object by processing/using the various command line arguments. <ref refid="classBpReceivePacketRunner" kindref="compound">BpReceivePacketRunner</ref> also provides a signal handler listener to capture Ctrl+C (SIGINT) events for clean termination. </para>
</sect1>
